    ability to generate sales of Motorola brand products sufficient to make that portion of our business profitable, and retain the Motorola
    brand license for the Motorola brand product we produce;</span></td></tr>
  <tr style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; vertical-align: top">
