<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt; text-align: justify; text-indent: 0.5in"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">Depreciation
expense was $<span id="xdx_909_eus-gaap--Depreciation_pn3n3_c20220101__20221231_zWF9Tq0u8qM" title="Depreciation"><ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:Depreciation" contextRef="From2022-01-01to2022-12-31" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="-3" scale="3" unitRef="USD">403</ix:nonFraction></span> thousand and $<span id="xdx_908_eus-gaap--Depreciation_pn3n3_c20210101__20211231_zSpgjZZ3TL9j" title="Depreciation expense"><ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:Depreciation" contextRef="From2021-01-012021-12-31" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="-3" scale="3" unitRef="USD">255</ix:nonFraction></span> thousand for the years ended December 31, 2022 and 2021, respectively.</span></p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt; text-align: justify; text-indent: 0.5in"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">&#160;</span></p>


